{"title":"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(One_Sentence)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (One Sentence)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Just_Fractions_One_Sentence)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Just Fractions One Sentence)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Carlos took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282fdef75f579c92565cd7e0734d83ccfd38bfdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of a whole pie. Maria took one third of the remainder. What portion of the whole pie was left?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b89e0bb96e03f792be1f4da8a6e017ac1a54caf3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10\\%\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15\\%\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\%\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 30\\%\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 35\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"469\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Carlos took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282fdef75f579c92565cd7e0734d83ccfd38bfdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the pie, there must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1ed0f8aec0440ba9a832086dbfd52a2532614751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(100 - 70)\\% = 30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" /> left. After Maria takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d00a60c7b2aa767c32a146a64527d8e860dded.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%, \\ 1 - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"38\" /> of the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is left.\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2ca433b1e9d5bb62cb0b4538ee383341c491aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\% \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\%}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"169\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~Awesome2.1 (Solution)\n</p><p>~quacker88 (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/latex.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\LaTeX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> Adjustments)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like solution 1, it is clear that there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the pie remaining. Since Maria takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the remainder, she takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d55da94ff835d97bb3b679ce4eae4bc52362d19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot 30\\% = 10\\%,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"38\" /> meaning that there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e404f6d4726da82cfb3b1ae7ad428d9b0ce67d23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\% - 10\\% = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"194\" height=\"31\" /> left.\n</p><p>~DBlack2021\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28One_Sentence.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(One_Sentence)\">Solution 3 (One Sentence)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (One Sentence)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce11cb93c4b54ee4c2318644ba2ce6fb8c76f81.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(100\\%-70\\%\\right)\\cdot\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)=30\\%\\cdot\\frac23=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20\\%}\\]\" width=\"381\" height=\"43\" /> of the whole pie left.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Just_Fractions_One_Sentence.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Just_Fractions_One_Sentence)\">Solution 4 (Just Fractions One Sentence)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Just Fractions One Sentence)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Conversion to fractions and simplification yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/0/57010aeec875ad01625ec707eca5fcc6a9d971c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3}{10} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{1}{5}\\]\" width=\"82\" height=\"37\" /> that remain for the pie. In percent, that ratio is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93c9a99580c7775956105512bf95975b39eb6822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{20 \\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"46\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qJF3G7_IDgc\">https://youtu.be/qJF3G7_IDgc</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1fkJ2Mm55Ls\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1fkJ2Mm55Ls</a>\n</p><p>~The Power of Logic\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HtVPh8AE5dI\">https://youtu.be/HtVPh8AE5dI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></s