A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2020 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" ti